[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that writes every record to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":", so records survive the app ending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" start with the ones "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" kept from earlier runs."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","text":"RecordStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","text":"Consent","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"enrichers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","text":"Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","text":"Sampler","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplingSeed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt64","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { Date.now })"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where each record is kept until it is delivered."}]}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written and delivered; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", every event delivered, by default.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"consent"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"enrichers"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers and before the store; none by default, so every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event is kept.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"samplers"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler’s rate of them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"samplingSeed"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"now"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker writes each record as it reaches it, before publishing it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", rather than a stage reading "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", which runs in the delivery’s task,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later, perhaps after a slow batch. Given "},{"code":"consent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a record is written once its category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is granted, not while it is held, and the recovered records are gated again. The worker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the recovered records from "},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything tracked."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Given ","type":"text"},{"code":"samplers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a record they drop is never written. A record the store recovered was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampled in the run that wrote it, so it isn’t sampled again.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent":{"role":"symbol","title":"Consent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"title":"Tracker","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/RecordStore":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a tracker keeps each record until it is delivered, so records survive the app ending."}],"title":"RecordStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"t